            "notes": "# Round 1\n\n## How?\n\n**Play passive!** In R1 you have very little survival, avoid overextending and taking duels. \n\nSpam [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) onto clumps of enemies to proc inspire.\n\nRather than bashing into enemies, shield bash behind you, or into a wall to ready the power.\n\n**AVOID USING SHIELD!** Unless necessary, keep your shield. If your shield breaks at any time (and any round) in this build you WILL die. Keeping your shield alive is critical.\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\nWe take [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) as next round we want to purchase [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4).",
