            "notes": "# Round 2\n\n## How?\n\nYou play R2 very similar to R1.\n\nDuring Rally, make sure to keep using  [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) and Whip Shot. Both of these will charge Rally even while you're using it!\n\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\n [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4) is a **MUST** pick for Brigitte. This will allow you to farm Rally insanely quickly.\n\nSell [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) if you cannot afford it, followed by [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).",
