            "notes": "# Round 4\n\n## How?\n\nWith the added shield health, you can play more aggressive, and begin to tank damage with your shield.\n\n## Why these Powers/Items?\nWhile  [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b) only grants 25 Armor, it allows your Shield to scale greatly with all the survival items we will be taking. As we don't take  [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) or  [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) with this build, this item is required to keep your shield active.\n\nIf you have the currency,  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and  [Squire's Satchel](item_b530e529-3bf4-4b7c-abe8-6e976a5c35bf) combo great with our Armour focused build.",
